    "qeet": {
      "$description": "Qeet — the brand ramp. 500 is #F26D0E exactly: the brand colour for identity, accents, the logo and brand text on dark. 600 is Qeet Ember (#D04800), the ACTION orange: the deepest shade that keeps the brand vivid while carrying white text at ≥4.5:1 (WCAG AA) — the brand orange itself is 3.0:1 with white. Steps past 500 shift toward red (47° → 32°) rather than only darkening, so deep oranges stay ember, not brown.",
